      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's not possible. Quest does not meet the requirements able to withstand all of the technical things to it. If you try to load in all of the PC only avatars and worlds, you will lag out to the point of crash, quest just simply does not meet the requirements. I suggest reading up on why they don't have that available in the first place. Take it from someone who has played the game for 2 years, and know why us PC users shit on quest users.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5dc1348ff1e64f435c84ad81",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5a95256f54d514123c1f089d",
        "alias": "Fuchsia Marmoset",
